<title>POLAND: PPABANK MAR NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>PPABANK MAR NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH   </p>
<p> Net profit					  1.12 vs    0.74</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.90 vs    0.81</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  4.47 vs    2.92</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 5.67 vs    4.10</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit					  3.02 vs    1.36</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    4.80 vs    2.40</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 12.28 vs    8.56</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	16.83 vs   11.62</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Pierwszy</p>
<p>Polsko-Amerykanski Bank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
